Harlan, Callenbach placed nine in-situ relative humidity probes per ASTM F2=
170 in the tenant conference suite and the level one and level two elevator=
 lobbies. Probes were drilled to forty percent depth in the normal weight s=
lab, sealed, and read at seventy two hours.<br />
<br />
Results ranged from 79 to 83 percent RH. The highest single reading was 83 =
percent at the level two lobby near the exterior wall, and the mean across =
all nine was 80.6 percent. Slab temperature was steady at sixty nine to sev=
enty one degrees throughout.<br />
<br />
For reference, your specification threshold is 85 percent. Every probe read=
 below it, and the spread is tight enough that I would not expect a differe=
nt answer from a second round. This is a fully cured, long enclosed normal =
weight slab drying from one face over thirty seven years, and it is behavin=
g accordingly.